["<div class=\"nb\"><p>Google DeepMind 发布 Gemini 4 Hydrogen，定位快速执行日常编码与智能体工作流，面向 Gemini API、AI Studio、Gemini 应用、Google Search 等全层级开放。</p></div><div class=\"act\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://aihot.news/items/uy1ayrrlqx1snqsv4lub7whsa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AIHOT ↗</a><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原文 ↗</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"cpy\" data-copy=\"https://aihot.news/items/uy1ayrrlqx1snqsv4lub7whsa\" aria-label=\"复制原文链接\" title=\"复制原文链接\"></button><span class=\"nm\">Google DeepMind：Blog · 日报 2026-11-13</span></div>","<div class=\"nb\"><p>Anthropic 推出 Claude Meetings beta，Claude 可作为可见参会者加入视频通话，在会中回答提问、协作创建文档和白板，并生成笔记和行动项。</p></div><div class=\"act\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://aihot.news/items/l36ne5q2gsdx6thyia7fi10kn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AIHOT ↗</a><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://claude.com/blog/claude-meetings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原文 ↗</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"cpy\" data-copy=\"https://aihot.news/items/l36ne5q2gsdx6thyia7fi10kn\" aria-label=\"复制原文链接\" title=\"复制原文链接\"></button><span class=\"nm\">Claude：Blog · 日报 2026-11-13</span></div>","<div class=\"nb\"><p>Anthropic 宣布 Claude Opus 5.5 成为 Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 套餐的默认模型，并推荐将其作为研究、分析和写作等知识工作的日常主力。</p></div><div class=\"act\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://aihot.news/items/t5pucqx6ac58z0ed1b0875ci0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AIHOT ↗</a><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://claude.com/blog/using-claude-opus-5-5-as-your-daily-driver-for-knowledge-work\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原文 ↗</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"cpy\" data-copy=\"https://aihot.news/items/t5pucqx6ac58z0ed1b0875ci0\" aria-label=\"复制原文链接\" title=\"复制原文链接\"></button><span class=\"nm\">Claude：Blog · 日报 2026-11-13</span></div>","<div class=\"nb\"><p>Josh Woodward 宣布 Google 智能眼镜开启预购，用户可在 <a href=\"https://glasses.google